        "spec": {
          "sourcePage": 24,
          "sourceRegion": "Question 15, upper-left position–time graph",
          "description": "Qualitative position graph with initial displacement −3, minimum (4, −5), zero at 8, maximum (12, 5), and a descending tail approaching the time axis. Dashed guides include the ordinate at 16.",
          "mathematics": "Displacement is negative before 8; stationary times are 4 and 12. The increasing section is steepest near 8, and the descending tail flattens.",
